OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins to block cars from
OL,4,Acity's road
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreparation work for a trial that will
OL,7,Frestrict cars driving through a central
OL,8,FCambridge street, to make it safer for
OL,9,Fpedestrians and cyclists, has begun.
OL,11,FThe trial on Sidgwick Avenue will last
OL,12,Fbetween a year and 18 months and
OL,13,Finvolve installing a retractable
OL,14,Fbollard in the middle of the road to
OL,15,Frestrict most vehicles.
OL,17,FThe Greater Cambridge Partnership
OL,18,F(GCP), which delivers transport
OL,19,Fprojects in the area, said access would
OL,20,Fbe maintained for emergency services.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
